---
epr-meta-version: 1
id: browser-lifecycle-bridge
covers: subtree
purpose: >
  Translate authenticated browser-origin requests to the shared peer-owned app lifecycle.
  Consumed by the native messaging host in steward/device. No session authority, observation
  storage, installation policy or process supervisor belongs in this library.
---

The host obtains caller origin from its transport, never a page-provided field. A configured
origin match is necessary but not sufficient: the peer AppRuntime checks resource authority.
The extension is an external adapter, replaceable without changing the runtime contracts.
Unsupported operations refuse. The foundation does not yet ship a native messaging host.
